Innovators treat magic as an engineering discipline. They take existing spells apart, isolate useful modifications, and turn those modifications into stable variants that other mages can learn. An Innovator’s legacy is not merely a personal repertoire, but an expanding body of rapid-fire attacks, selective wards, long-range healing, and other improved spells that permanently enlarge the magical vocabulary of the setting.

